        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Petco Mexico (118 stores, 2,000+ terminals), Incredible Pets, and Royal Pets. The platform serves pet retail chains that need enterprise-scale POS, loyalty, inventory management, and the Shopper Services advertising platform.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
